<title>FINLAND: SANTASALO-JOT SET 51 MARKKA ISSUE PRICE.</title>
<headline>SANTASALO-JOT SET 51 MARKKA ISSUE PRICE.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish engineering group Santasalo-JOT said in a statement on Tuesday its planned issue of 600,000 new shares had been oversubscribed and set the issue price at 51 markka per share.</p>
<p>&quot;There were almost three times as many subscriptions compared to the preliminarily offered 600,000 shares with 10 markka nominal value,&quot; it said, adding that the board had confirmed the issue size at 600,000.</p>
<p>Of this, 390,000 shares would be allocated to foreign investors and 210,000 to domestic investors.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 242, news@reuters.fi</p>
